      "message": "I\u0027ve been trying out using a prebuilt binary from a generated snapshot. Making the versioned binaries not installed helps, but in my case it needs to work with the source modules still in place, and I think that\u0027s a setup we\u0027ll want to support going forward, regardless of unbundling approach.\n\nHence I think this also need to be installable:false, and furthermore prefer:true. Any reasons against that?\n\n(Just bringing it up for discussion - changing it doesn\u0027t belong on this CL.)",
